<title>USA: CBOE says seat sells for record $650,000.</title>
<headline>CBOE says seat sells for record $650,000.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Thursday an exchange membership sold Wednesday for a record $650,000.</p>
<p>It said the previous record seat price was $635,000 set March 31.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
